@startuml domain-accounts
title Accounts, roles and regular groups

top to bottom direction
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam classBorderColor #64748B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<AggregateRoot>> #DBEAFE
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<ValueObject>> #DCFCE7
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<RoleView>> #F3E8FF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40

class Booker <<RoleView>> {
  +userId : UUID
  --
  +assertCanCreateSession() : void
  +createSession(...) : Session
  +cancel(...) : FinancialResult
  +changeVisibility(...) : void
  +removeParticipant(...) : FinancialResult
  +verifyAttendance(...) : void
  +preparePayout(...) : PayoutBatch [0..1]
}

class Participant <<RoleView>> {
  +userId : UUID
  --
  +join(...) : ParticipantJoinResult
  +acceptReplacement(...) : ParticipantJoinResult
  +promoteFromWaitlist(...) : PromotionResult
  +leaveWaitlist(...) : void
  +withdraw(...) : WithdrawalResult
  +previewWithdrawal(...) : WithdrawalPreview
}

class User <<AggregateRoot>> {
  +userId : UUID
  +emailVerified : boolean
  +accountStatus : AccountStatus
  +reliabilityScore : ReliabilityScore
  +memberGroupIds : UUID[] {readOnly}
  --
  {static} +create(...) : User
  +updateProfile(...) : void
  +updatePreferences(...) : void
  +beginPayoutSetup(...) : void
  +completePayoutSetup(...) : void
  +failPayoutSetup() : void
  +payoutDestination() : PayoutDestination
  +asBooker() : Booker
  +asParticipant() : Participant
  +deactivate(...) : void
}

class Wallet <<ImmutableChild>> {
  +walletId : UUID
  +userId : UUID
  --
  +getAvailableBalance() : Money
}

class Email <<ValueObject>> {
  +toString() : string
  +equals(...) : boolean
}

class UserHandle <<ValueObject>> {
  {static} +parse(...) : UserHandle
  +toString() : string
  +toDisplay() : string
  +equals(...) : boolean
}

class PayoutAccount <<ImmutableChild>> {
  +payoutAccountId : UUID
  +userId : UUID
  +setupStatus : PayoutSetupStatus
  --
  +completeSetup(...) : PayoutAccount
  +failSetup() : PayoutAccount
}

class RegularGroup <<AggregateRoot>> {
  +groupId : UUID
  +ownerId : UUID
  +name : string
  +status : GroupStatus
  +invitationActive : boolean
  --
  {static} +create(...) : RegularGroup
  +join(...) : GroupJoinResult
  +removeMember(...) : void
  +leave(...) : void
  +rotateInvitation(...) : void
  +archive(...) : void
}

class GroupMembership <<ImmutableChild>> {
  +userId : UUID
  +joinedAt : Date
}

Booker "0..*" -down-> "1" User : wraps
Participant "0..*" -down-> "1" User : wraps
User "1" *-down- "1" Wallet : wallet
User "1" *-down- "0..1" PayoutAccount : payoutAccount
User -down-> "0..1" Email : email
RegularGroup "1" *-down- "1..*" GroupMembership : memberships
RegularGroup "0..*" -left-> "1" User : ownerId {ID reference}
GroupMembership "0..*" -left-> "1" User : userId {ID reference}

note bottom of RegularGroup
  Membership user IDs are unique within a group.
  The owner is always a member and cannot be removed or leave.
end note

note bottom of User
  UC1-03 profile edits use prepareProfileUpdate(...)
  without loading User (ADR-0014). The public user ID
  is a UserHandle on the profile, outside User (ADR-0021).
  Deactivation shares assertDeactivationAllowed(...).
end note

User -[hidden]right- RegularGroup
Wallet -[hidden]right- Email
Email -[hidden]right- UserHandle
UserHandle -[hidden]right- PayoutAccount

caption Selected public members; (...) abbreviates parameters.\nRoles authorize actors and run workflows; Session validates and records prepared changes.\nSession creation/admission require an active account and a present email, without requiring email confirmation.\nWallet uses committed ledger history; reliability and group IDs are loaded related values.
@enduml
